Covers: gte-small-q8_0.gguf in this directory.

This file is redistributed byte-for-byte from
https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/gte-small-Q8_0-GGUF, a Q8_0 GGUF quantization
of https://huggingface.co/thenlper/gte-small.

Both repositories declare their licence in the model-card metadata field
`license: mit`, and neither ships a LICENSE file, so neither source publishes a
copyright line of its own. The card of the original states: "The GTE models are
trained by Alibaba DAMO Academy." The holder named below therefore rests on that
statement and on the accompanying paper (Li et al., "Towards General Text
Embeddings with Multi-stage Contrastive Learning", arXiv:2308.03281, 2023), not
on a licence text supplied by either repository.

